# Dragon Magazine Compendium - alternative class features for classes of Complete Adventurer (loaded only with it; acf_build.py).

Blinding Flash	KEY:Ninja ACF ~ Blinding Flash (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.NinjaACF.NinjaGhostStep	PRECLASS:1,Ninja=2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Blinding Flash (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.396	DESC:Alternative class feature (ninja, 2nd level). Spend one daily use of ki power (swift action, no attack of opportunity) to burst into flames: everyone within 20 feet must make a Reflex save (DC %1 as printed: 20 + half your ninja level + Wisdom modifier) or be blinded for 1 round (dazzled for 1 round on a success). Like ghost step it improves at higher levels as the compendium describes. Replaces ghost step (and its improvements). The ninja's ghost step is granted without an ACF guard - remove it by hand.
Blinding Flash	KEY:ACF ~ Blinding Flash (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ninja Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.396	DESC:Spend one daily use of ki power (swift action, no attack of opportunity) to burst into flames: everyone within 20 feet must make a Reflex save (DC %1 as printed: 20 + half your ninja level + Wisdom modifier) or be blinded for 1 round (dazzled for 1 round on a success). Like ghost step it improves at higher levels as the compendium describes. Replaces ghost step (and its improvements). The ninja's ghost step is granted without an ACF guard - remove it by hand.|20+floor(NinjaLVL/2)+WIS
Deceptive Mist	KEY:Ninja ACF ~ Deceptive Mist (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.NinjaACF.NinjaGhostStep	PRECLASS:1,Ninja=2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Deceptive Mist (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.396	DESC:Alternative class feature (ninja, 2nd level). Spend one daily use of ki power to create a thick fog like obscuring mist, a stationary cylinder 20 feet high and 20 feet in radius centered on you, lasting 1 round (it disperses if you leave it); your own vision is not impeded by it. Improves at higher levels as the compendium describes. Replaces ghost step (and its improvements). The ninja's ghost step is granted without an ACF guard - remove it by hand.
Deceptive Mist	KEY:ACF ~ Deceptive Mist (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ninja Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.396	DESC:Spend one daily use of ki power to create a thick fog like obscuring mist, a stationary cylinder 20 feet high and 20 feet in radius centered on you, lasting 1 round (it disperses if you leave it); your own vision is not impeded by it. Improves at higher levels as the compendium describes. Replaces ghost step (and its improvements). The ninja's ghost step is granted without an ACF guard - remove it by hand.
One with the Earth	KEY:Ninja ACF ~ One with the Earth (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.NinjaACF.NinjaGhostStep	PRECLASS:1,Ninja=2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ One with the Earth (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.397	DESC:Alternative class feature (ninja, 2nd level). Spend one daily use of ki power (swift action) to meld into stone as the spell for up to 1 minute, maintained by one more use per minute; from 8th level a burrow speed equal to your land speed for 1 round, improving further as the compendium describes. Replaces ghost step (and its improvements). The ninja's ghost step is granted without an ACF guard - remove it by hand.
One with the Earth	KEY:ACF ~ One with the Earth (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ninja Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.397	DESC:Spend one daily use of ki power (swift action) to meld into stone as the spell for up to 1 minute, maintained by one more use per minute; from 8th level a burrow speed equal to your land speed for 1 round, improving further as the compendium describes. Replaces ghost step (and its improvements). The ninja's ghost step is granted without an ACF guard - remove it by hand.
Aquatic Scout	KEY:Scout ACF ~ Aquatic Scout (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.ScoutACF.ScoutFastMovement	PRECLASS:1,Scout=3	PREMOVE:1,Swim=1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Aquatic Scout (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.531	DESC:Alternative class feature (scout, 3rd level). A scout with a racial swim speed applies the fast movement bonus to the swim speed instead of the land speed (+%1 feet now: +10 at 3rd, +20 at 11th; applied in no or light armor - not with a medium or heavy load, by hand); flawless stride also works underwater, and at 18th level free movement works underwater as freedom of movement. Replaces fast movement on land.
Aquatic Scout	KEY:ACF ~ Aquatic Scout (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Scout Class Feature	BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE.Swim|10*((ScoutLVL>=3)+(ScoutLVL>=11))|!PREEQUIP:1,TYPE=Armor.Medium,TYPE=Armor.Heavy	SOURCEPAGE:p.531	DESC:A scout with a racial swim speed applies the fast movement bonus to the swim speed instead of the land speed (+%1 feet now: +10 at 3rd, +20 at 11th; applied in no or light armor - not with a medium or heavy load, by hand); flawless stride also works underwater, and at 18th level free movement works underwater as freedom of movement. Replaces fast movement on land.|10*((ScoutLVL>=3)+(ScoutLVL>=11))
Light Cavalry	KEY:Scout ACF ~ Light Cavalry (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.ScoutACF.ScoutFastMovement.ScoutCamouflage.ScoutHideinPlainSight.ScoutFreeMovement	PRECLASS:1,Scout=5	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Light Cavalry (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.532	DESC:Alternative class feature (scout, 5th level). At 5th level you gain a special mount as a paladin of your scout level (applied), with minor changes: it must be fast and is usually a small member of its species without Hit Die advancement; it gives up share spells and command creatures of its kind for other benefits described in the compendium. Replaces fast movement, camouflage, hide in plain sight and free movement.
Light Cavalry	KEY:ACF ~ Light Cavalry (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Scout Class Feature	ABILITY:Paladin Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Paladin ~ Special Mount|PREVARGTEQ:ScoutLVL,5	BONUS:VAR|SpecialMountLVL|ScoutLVL	SOURCEPAGE:p.532	DESC:At 5th level you gain a special mount as a paladin of your scout level (applied), with minor changes: it must be fast and is usually a small member of its species without Hit Die advancement; it gives up share spells and command creatures of its kind for other benefits described in the compendium. Replaces fast movement, camouflage, hide in plain sight and free movement.
Skilled City-Dweller	KEY:Scout ACF ~ Skilled City-Dweller (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.ScoutACF.ScoutCityDweller	PRECLASS:1,Scout=1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Skilled City-Dweller (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.533	DESC:Alternative class feature (scout, 1st level). Urban scouts may swap class skills, each swap chosen once and never changed: Handle Animal for Gather Information, Knowledge (nature) for Knowledge (local), Survival for Sense Motive, Ride for Tumble (only if the scout has the skill to lose). Optional and partial swaps allowed. By hand: an ACF cannot remove class skills in PCGen 6.08 - add the gained skills as class skills and treat the lost ones as cross-class.
Skilled City-Dweller	KEY:ACF ~ Skilled City-Dweller (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Scout Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.533	DESC:Urban scouts may swap class skills, each swap chosen once and never changed: Handle Animal for Gather Information, Knowledge (nature) for Knowledge (local), Survival for Sense Motive, Ride for Tumble (only if the scout has the skill to lose). Optional and partial swaps allowed. By hand: an ACF cannot remove class skills in PCGen 6.08 - add the gained skills as class skills and treat the lost ones as cross-class.
Sniper	KEY:Scout ACF ~ Sniper (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.ScoutACF.ScoutFastMovement	PRECLASS:1,Scout=1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Sniper (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.534	DESC:Alternative class feature (scout, 1st level). Precise shots at long range: as a full-round action, a ranged attack with a missile weapon against a target farther than 60 feet deals +%1d6 damage if it hits (1d6 at 1st, +1d6 per four levels: 2d6 at 5th ... 5d6 at 17th); you cannot move, not even a 5-foot step, that round; only living creatures with discernible anatomy (not undead, constructs, oozes, plants, incorporeal creatures or those immune to extra damage from critical hits). Replaces skirmish (no ACF guard in the repository - remove it by hand) and fast movement.
Sniper	KEY:ACF ~ Sniper (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Scout Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.534	DESC:Precise shots at long range: as a full-round action, a ranged attack with a missile weapon against a target farther than 60 feet deals +%1d6 damage if it hits (1d6 at 1st, +1d6 per four levels: 2d6 at 5th ... 5d6 at 17th); you cannot move, not even a 5-foot step, that round; only living creatures with discernible anatomy (not undead, constructs, oozes, plants, incorporeal creatures or those immune to extra damage from critical hits). Replaces skirmish (no ACF guard in the repository - remove it by hand) and fast movement.|1+floor((ScoutLVL-1)/4)
Cursed Blow	KEY:Spellthief ACF ~ Cursed Blow (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.SpellthiefACF.SpellthiefSneak5	PRECLASS:1,Spellthief=5	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Cursed Blow (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.598	DESC:Alternative class feature (spellthief, 5th level). Whenever you deal sneak attack damage you may expend a spell slot (up to 4th level) as a free action to curse the target: a penalty equal to the slot's level on attack rolls, saving throws and skill checks for rounds equal to your spellthief level (%1). Replaces the sneak attack increase at 5th level: one die fewer from then on (applied).
Cursed Blow	KEY:ACF ~ Cursed Blow (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Spellthief Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|SneakAttackDice|-1|PREVARGTEQ:SpellthiefLVL,5	SOURCEPAGE:p.598	DESC:Whenever you deal sneak attack damage you may expend a spell slot (up to 4th level) as a free action to curse the target: a penalty equal to the slot's level on attack rolls, saving throws and skill checks for rounds equal to your spellthief level (%1). Replaces the sneak attack increase at 5th level: one die fewer from then on (applied).|SpellthiefLVL
Hamper Magic	KEY:Spellthief ACF ~ Hamper Magic (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.SpellthiefACF.SpellthiefStealEnergy	PRECLASS:1,Spellthief=3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hamper Magic (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.598	DESC:Alternative class feature (spellthief, 3rd level). Making a sneak attack you can give up 1d6 or more of its extra damage to hamper magic: against a spellcaster or creature with spell-like abilities its caster level drops by 1 per three spellthief levels (%1); a caster level of 0 prevents spells; further effects against supernatural abilities as the compendium describes. Replaces steal energy resistance and the steal spell-like ability feature of 5th level (no ACF guards in the repository - remove them by hand).
Hamper Magic	KEY:ACF ~ Hamper Magic (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Spellthief Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.598	DESC:Making a sneak attack you can give up 1d6 or more of its extra damage to hamper magic: against a spellcaster or creature with spell-like abilities its caster level drops by 1 per three spellthief levels (%1); a caster level of 0 prevents spells; further effects against supernatural abilities as the compendium describes. Replaces steal energy resistance and the steal spell-like ability feature of 5th level (no ACF guards in the repository - remove them by hand).|floor(SpellthiefLVL/3)
Spelleater	KEY:Spellthief ACF ~ Spelleater (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.SpellthiefACF.SpellthiefAbsorbSpell	PRECLASS:1,Spellthief=7	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Spelleater (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.599	DESC:Alternative class feature (spellthief, 7th level). Any time you steal a spell or spell-like ability you may instead consume its energy (swift action), healing 2 hit points per spell level; you may also consume stolen spells you kept for later; improved at 12th level as the compendium describes. Replaces absorb spell (no ACF guard - remove it by hand).
Spelleater	KEY:ACF ~ Spelleater (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Spellthief Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.599	DESC:Any time you steal a spell or spell-like ability you may instead consume its energy (swift action), healing 2 hit points per spell level; you may also consume stolen spells you kept for later; improved at 12th level as the compendium describes. Replaces absorb spell (no ACF guard - remove it by hand).
Spellskill	KEY:Spellthief ACF ~ Spellskill (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.SpellthiefACF.SpellthiefSpellcasting	PRECLASS:1,Spellthief=4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Spellskill (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.599	DESC:Alternative class feature (spellthief, 4th level). You channel your arcane power into your skills: a temporary enhancement bonus of +%1 (one-third of your spellthief level) to a pair of skills, extending to more skills as you gain levels (as the compendium describes). Replaces spellcasting (remove the spellthief's spells by hand - no ACF guard).
Spellskill	KEY:ACF ~ Spellskill (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Spellthief Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.599	DESC:You channel your arcane power into your skills: a temporary enhancement bonus of +%1 (one-third of your spellthief level) to a pair of skills, extending to more skills as you gain levels (as the compendium describes). Replaces spellcasting (remove the spellthief's spells by hand - no ACF guard).|floor(SpellthiefLVL/3)
Trickster	KEY:Spellthief ACF ~ Trickster (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.SpellthiefACF.SpellthiefTrickster	PRECLASS:1,Spellthief=1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Trickster (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.600	DESC:Alternative class feature (spellthief, 1st level). You cast spells as a bard of your spellthief level (caster level = spellthief level, spells per day and known as a bard, casting from 1st level), choosing spells known from the spellthief and bard lists; you lose 2 skill points per level (by hand: the spellthief's spellcasting and skill points are not changed automatically).
Trickster	KEY:ACF ~ Trickster (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Spellthief Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.600	DESC:You cast spells as a bard of your spellthief level (caster level = spellthief level, spells per day and known as a bard, casting from 1st level), choosing spells known from the spellthief and bard lists; you lose 2 skill points per level (by hand: the spellthief's spellcasting and skill points are not changed automatically).
